-# Devise sign-in view. Renders the same shared sign-in form as the
-# ambient `/` landing so failed-login re-renders and expired-session
-# redirects don't jump the user to a different-looking page.
-# Prefill: pass `params.dig(:user, :email)` so a failed login keeps
-# the typed email in the field. Password is deliberately not
-# prefilled.

- content_for :page_title do
  = t('auth.login')

= render 'auth/shared/sign_in_form', prefill_email: params.dig(:user, :email)
